# Quarto build cache — regenerated on every render.
/.quarto/

# NOTE: `docs/` is intentionally NOT ignored. GitHub Pages serves the site
# from that directory on the master branch, so the rendered output must be
# committed. See README.md.

# Full-resolution photo originals. Only the optimised derivatives
# (e.g. images/profile.jpg) belong in a public repo.
images/IMG_*.jpeg
images/IMG_*.jpg

# Working notes. This is a PUBLIC repo, so the project handoff must never be
# committed — it is a Dropbox-synced working file, not site content.
handoff.md

# The unredacted 4-page CV. Its page 4 lists referees' phone numbers and
# emails, which must not be published. files/cv.pdf is the 3-page public
# version (pages 1-3 only). Never commit this file.
files/cv-full-private.pdf

.DS_Store
*.icloud

# Dropbox conflicted copies, in case one slips in
*conflicted copy*

**/*.quarto_ipynb
